Subject: [PATCH 03/50] =?UTF-8?q?qualcommax:=20ipq807x:=20EWS377AP=20v3=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20draft=20Ethernet=20from=20confirmed=20OEM=20topolog?=
 =?UTF-8?q?y?=
